    <!--
        ADDED 2026-08-31, POST-DEPLOY FIX. Same reasoning as DPEG_Checklist_Edit's identical block -
        Checklist__c is Master-Detail to Transaction__c, and this set's Read grant on Checklist__c is
        refused outright without a Read grant on Transaction__c IN THIS SAME FILE ("Permission Read
